sequenceDiagram
  participant App as App (useSaveEvent)
  participant PR as PostgREST / RLS
  participant F as save_event() (SECURITY INVOKER)
  participant T as Triggers (capacity, material change, waitlist_promoted)
  App->>PR: POST rpc/save_event {edit_id?, event, dates[], tag_ids[]}
  PR->>F: run as authenticated (auth.uid())
  F->>F: validate (title, duration, dates ≤ 52, price ≥ 0)
  alt create
    F->>PR: INSERT events (one row per date) [RLS: created_by = auth.uid()]
  else edit
    F->>PR: UPDATE events WHERE id = edit_id [RLS: creator only]
    F->>T: material-change trigger notifies attendees (unchanged)
  end
  F->>PR: event_tags: delete removed, insert added (same transaction)
  opt edit raised max_attendees
    F->>PR: UPDATE event_attendees SET status='attending'<br/>oldest waitlisted, FOR UPDATE, up to new spots
    PR->>T: notify_on_waitlist_promoted (unchanged)
  end
  F-->>App: {event_ids[]} — or error: nothing was written
  App->>App: invalidate feed / club / event(id) / templates
